      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REAL BONNIE (2) was below best latest but did hit the frame in quick time two back when second (29.87) at The Gardens in a Grade 4/5. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. NATISA'S SECRET (4) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Hey Mac (29.52) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature again. SMART STYLE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.23) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here including three wins. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. FASCINATE SUZIE (8) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
